      "Original": "(Aoi and Byakko, reading a magazine together...what a cute sight.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00028_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(You know what? I'm going to study some history.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00029_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Since we're the last hope of humanity, learning about our history is important.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00030_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Let's see...how about something on super ancient history?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00031_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Nngh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00032_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "No way! So ancient Sumerian civilizations were created by ALIENS?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00033_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(I guess there's good aliens out there.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00034_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(I'll read some books on philosophy. Understanding the nature of mankind is the first step in understanding your own self.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00035_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Socrates? That sounds familiar, I guess I'll give it a go.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00036_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Nngh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00037_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "...Yep! I understand absolutely none of this!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00038_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Only god knows, I guess.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00039_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Like, hello??? Mr. Socrates? Why did you leave it all open to interpretation like this...?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00040_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "(That was a pretty informative.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtLibrary_00041_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "(Okay, time to get back.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
